{"id":"n26673-1-7","stage":4,"title":"개운하다 · 爽快","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26673-1-7-1","ko":"오랜만에 운동을 하니까 기분이 좋다.","zh":"好久没运动了，感觉真好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만에","audio":"/audio/cf175d7879a1bf3c7749.mp3"}},{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동을","audio":"/audio/0ba24f283476666840e3.mp3"}},{"text":"하니까","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니까","audio":"/audio/c5687c04fe55d30da1c1.mp3"}},{"text":"기분이","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기분이","audio":"/audio/2c7d19f699b942f8cc0b.mp3"}},{"text":"좋다.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f90e93626912b9281f5c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26673-1-7-2","ko":"찬물로 씻고 나면 몸도 아주 개운할 거야.","zh":"用冷水洗完澡后，身体肯定会觉得特别清爽。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"찬물로","meaning":"冷水，冰水","explanation":"찬물：冷水，冰水；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"찬물","audio":"/audio/658c6529afb87c66be35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71464","senseId":"1","lemma":"찬물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찬물로","audio":"/audio/7b766c0cec6eb25a7f5e.mp3"}},{"text":"씻고","meaning":"洗，刷","explanation":"씻다：洗，刷；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"씻다","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17191","senseId":"1","lemma":"씻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씻고","audio":"/audio/306c2e1e6609bdca733c.mp3"}},{"text":"나면","meaning":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","explanation":"나다：做完前面的动作（-고 나다）；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62134","senseId":"1","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나면","audio":"/audio/ee17327fab986ee28443.mp3"}},{"text":"몸도","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸도","audio":"/audio/98f3f0e5200df4876553.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"개운할","meaning":"爽快，轻松","explanation":"개운하다：爽快，轻松；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"개운하다","audio":"/audio/0c4853cb02b40494e5d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26673","senseId":"1","lemma":"개운하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개운할","audio":"/audio/9ad992f281e76538c8c0.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"658c6529afb87c66","term":"찬물","zh":"冷水，冰水","audio":"/audio/658c6529afb87c66be35.mp3","entryId":"71464","definition":"冰冷的水。","pronunciation":["찬물"]},{"id":"1fc19ed194af1338","term":"씻다","zh":"洗，刷","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3","entryId":"17191","definition":"除去污垢或脏的东西而使之干净。","pronunciation":["씯따"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62134","definition":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{